OL,3,GNEWSAGrade I listed building closes for
OL,4,A#2.5m renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade I listed building described by
OL,7,Fan architectural historian as one of
OL,8,F"the most perfect classical buildings
OL,9,Fin provincial England" has closed for
OL,10,F#2.5m renovation work.
OL,12,FSir Nikolaus Pevsner praised the design
OL,13,Fof Custom House in King's Lynn,
OL,14,FNorfolk, in his book The Buildings of
OL,15,FEngland.
