OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGrade I listed building closes for
OL,4,A#2.5m renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe property, which was designed by
OL,7,FKing's Lynn native Henry Bell and
OL,8,Foriginally built as a merchant's
OL,9,Fexchange in 1683, has been shut for
OL,10,Frepairs to be carried out on its roof
OL,11,Fand for a lift to be installed to
OL,12,Fimprove accessibility.
OL,14,FThe Borough Council of King's Lynn and
OL,15,FWest Norfolk said the project was
OL,16,Ffinanced by the government's Town Deal,
OL,17,Fexternal funding and was expected to
OL,18,Ftake 12 months to complete.
